{"title":"豆包工作 × Stata 在线书籍","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"豆包工作 × Stata 在线书籍","pagetitle":"豆包工作 × Stata 在线书籍","page-layout":"full","toc":false,"sidebar":false,"description":"面向经管社科因果推断的组织智能体科研流水线 —— 豆包工作 + AIStata MCP + Stata-Kernel-Jupyter"},"headingText":"导语：为什么是这套工具链","headingAttr":{"id":"why","classes":[],"keyvalue":[]},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     Hero 区域 —— 主视觉与核心行动号召\n     ============================================================ -->\n<section class=\"econ-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"econ-hero__content\">\n    <span class=\"econ-eyebrow\">在线讲义 · 组织智能体 · 因果实证科研</span>\n    <h1 id=\"hero-title\">豆包工作 × Stata 在线书籍</h1>\n    <p class=\"econ-hero__lead\">\n      豆包工作 + AIStata MCP + Stata-Kernel-Jupyter<br>\n      面向经管社科因果推断的组织智能体科研流水线\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"econ-hero__tech\">\n      <span>组织智能体</span>\n      <span>MCP 连接器</span>\n      <span>常驻内核</span>\n      <span>论文复现</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"econ-hero__subtitle\">\n      从工具链部署、Stata 内核接入，到论文复现与批量实证作业调度，把「写—跑—验—交」串成可协同、可留痕、可复现的完整链路。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"econ-hero__meta\">\n      <span>4 大章节</span>\n      <span>7 份原始讲义</span>\n      <span>双形态 Stata 扩展</span>\n      <span>持续更新</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-actions\">\n      <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--primary\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">开始阅读</a>\n      <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--outline\" href=\"#compat\">了解兼容性</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     数据统计条\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-stats\">\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">4</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">核心章节</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">7</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">讲义文档</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\"> \n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">扩展形态</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">L4</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">组织级调度</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n\n本站以**讲义原文为主线**，围绕豆包工作中的 Stata 执行能力展开：先用组织智能体范式理解\"人—AI—工具\"的分工，再把 AIStata MCP 与 Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 接进日常科研，最后落到论文复现与整条实证科研流水线。\n\n一句话概括这套组合的定位：\n\n> 豆包工作 + AIStata MCP + Stata-Kernel-Jupyter —— 面向经管社科因果推断的组织智能体科研流水线。\n\n这套组合提供两条接入形态：**VS Code 扩展插件**与 **MCP 协议连接器**。下面的章节按\"范式认知 → 工具接入 → 论文复现 → 流水线调度\"的顺序展开。\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     兼容性说明 —— 主流 Agent / IDE 卡片网格\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-compat\" id=\"compat\">\n  <div class=\"econ-compat__head\">\n    <h2>主流 AI Agent / IDE，都能接上我们的 Stata 扩展</h2>\n    <p>自研扩展同时提供 VS Code 扩展插件与 MCP 协议两种形态 —— 凡是支持任一种的 Agent 与编辑器，都能与 Stata 交互执行、读数据、出图。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-agent-grid\">\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#f1f3f5;--icon-fg:#343a40\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.6 20.2 7v10L12 21.4 3.8 17V7Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Codex</strong><small>OpenAI 编码 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#fbede8;--icon-fg:#d97757\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\"/></g><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Claude Code</strong><small>Anthropic 终端 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#eef0f3;--icon-fg:#111827\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.2\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>OpenCode</strong><small>开源编码 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e7f0ff;--icon-fg:#2563eb\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"15.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">WB</text></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>WorkBuddy</strong><small>国产 Agent 工作台</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badges\"><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e6f7ee;--icon-fg:#14a06a\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5.5h16v10.5H9l-5 4Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Trae / TraeCN</strong><small>国产 AI IDE · 字节出品</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badges\"><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e9f8ef;--icon-fg:#159947\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8.5 8 4 4-4 4M13 16h3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>TraeWork</strong><small>原 TraeSolo · 工作流</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e8f0ff;--icon-fg:#4d6bfe\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6.5 13.5c2.2-4.8 6.8-5.7 10.8-2.4-1.6 4.5-6 6.6-10.8 2.4Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>DeepSeek Harness</strong><small>深度探索 Agent 框架</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e7f0ff;--icon-fg:#2563eb\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"15.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">DB</text></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>豆包工作</strong><small>字节跳动 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e6f2ff;--icon-fg:#007acc\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3 19 12 5 21V3Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8.5 8.5 6.5 3.5-6.5 3.5Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>VS Code 扩展</strong><small>微软编辑器原生扩展</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#eef0f3;--icon-fg:#24292f\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 7.2a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1.5 9.36c.24.05.33-.1.33-.24v-.9c-1.35.3-1.64-.57-1.64-.57-.22-.56-.54-.71-.54-.71-.44-.3.03-.3.03-.3.49.03.75.5.75.5.44.75 1.14.53 1.42.4.04-.32.17-.53.31-.65-1.08-.12-2.22-.54-2.22-2.4 0-.53.19-.96.5-1.3-.05-.12-.22-.62.05-1.28 0 0 .4-.13 1.33.5a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 2.42 0c.92-.63 1.32-.5 1.32-.5.28.66.1 1.16.05 1.28.31.34.5.77.5 1.3 0 1.87-1.14 2.28-2.23 2.4.18.15.33.45.33.91v1.35c0 .13.09.29.33.24A4.8 4.8 0 0 0 12 7.2Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>GitHub Copilot</strong><small>GitHub 编码助手</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#f3eefe;--icon-fg:#7c3aed\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8 7 8 5-8 5Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Cursor / Windsurf</strong><small>AI 原生编辑器 · 含 Cline / Roo Code</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#fff3e6;--icon-fg:#e07a39\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.6\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"8.6\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Jupyter / Quarto</strong><small>笔记本与动态文档</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 实战文章与接入指南 {#articles}\n\n从一站式科研平台到 Claude Code、DeepSeek Harness、opencode、Codex、豆包工作、GitHub Copilot、TraeCN / TraeWork，这些实战记录完整呈现了各家 Agent 与 IDE 调用 Stata 的过程；另附 MCP 接入与平台适配说明。\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-article-group\">\n  <h3 class=\"econ-article-group__title\">在各家 Agent 里跑 Stata</h3>\n  <div class=\"econ-article-grid\">\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kar5Ty8vMOgHDKtu33qFmA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">01</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在一站式科研平台里面用 ClaudeCode 跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>Claude Code · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770814&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=52593905910f16382a151573bba24346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">02</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 DeepseekHarness 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>DeepSeek Harness · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770748&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9045c7a7b07832934cb070739d642440&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">03</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 opencode 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>OpenCode · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770765&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e41b43f003b3472afa470d255779e977&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">04</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 Codex 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>Codex · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770651&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=179721060d58c1cc9f262b8d1f3080c8&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">05</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 豆包工作 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>豆包工作 · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770789&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d7fc875ff23132232c9472b1154afd66&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">06</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 GithubCopilot 里跑 Stata 代码 Bacon 分解</strong><small>GitHub Copilot · Bacon 分解</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770799&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=11c1bcd3b185a315a410390a663e1df6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">07</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 TraeCN/TraeWork 跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>TraeCN / TraeWork · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-article-group\">\n  <h3 class=\"econ-article-group__title\">MCP 接入与平台适配</h3>\n  <div class=\"econ-article-grid\">\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qiQzZ6amy_hTi1SlVE6uqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">08</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>AIStata MCP 接入主流 Agent 平台</strong><small>MCP · 接入指南</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770556&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a4fb8f2bce01c511dd2f1d255e7d7c9a&amp;scene=142&amp;poc_token=HBxrAmujL-gt_e5_EclIHaUaL1DnYu0VngDTtJK0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">09</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>AIStata MCP 全面适配 Workbuddy、Trae、ClaudeCode 等主流 AI Agent，附论文复现展示</strong><small>MCP · 适配与论文复现</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 内容概览\n\n本在线书籍按四章组织，正文均来自原始讲义，仅作章节化排版与导航整理。配套仓库、公开课入口与项目主页见「资源导航」。\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     章节卡片网格\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-card-grid\">\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 1 章</span>\n    <h3>豆包工作流</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">从 AI × 计量工具的四条技术路线讲起，厘清组织智能体\"委派—并行—校验—交付\"范式，并完成环境搭建、MCP 接入与连通性验证。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 × StataMCP 实证科研流水线（讲义全本上篇）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/02-stata.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 2 章</span>\n    <h3>Stata专题</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">三份讲义合并编排：Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 扩展简介、在豆包工作中的连接器入门，以及计量经济网科研平台中的综合应用。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：扩展简介 / 豆包工作入门指南 / 科研平台应用</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/03-reproduction.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 3 章</span>\n    <h3>论文复现</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">以单任务因果推断的标准调度流为主线，覆盖 DID、RDD、PSM 全流程，并延伸到前沿方法矩阵、飞书协同闭环与学术伦理。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 · 论文复现专题（讲义全本中下篇）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/04-pipeline.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 4 章</span>\n    <h3>实证科研流</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">完整呈现组织智能体驱动的因果实证科研流水线：批次设计、并行委派、交付包规范、容错重跑与综合实战工坊。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 × StataMCP 实证科研流水线（全本）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/05-resources.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">附录</span>\n    <h3>资源导航</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">本书仓库、最新公开课与系列专题课入口，AIStata MCP 与 Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 项目主页，以及 AI 工具导航与配套课程。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">查看资源 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：在线资源</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 学习路径 {#roadmap}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-flow\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"在线书籍学习路径\">\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">豆包工作流</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">Stata专题</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">论文复现</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">实证科研流</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">资源导航</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n| 如果你的目标是 | 建议从哪里开始 |\n|:---------------|:---------------|\n| 判断该用哪条 AI × Stata 路线 | 第 1 章：豆包工作流 |\n| 在 VS Code / Jupyter / 豆包工作里跑通 Stata | 第 2 章：Stata专题 |\n| 复现一篇因果推断论文并留存交付物 | 第 3 章：论文复现 |\n| 给课题组搭建批量检验与评审闭环 | 第 4 章：实证科研流 |\n| 找到仓库、公开课与项目主页 | 附录：资源导航 |\n\n::: {.callout-note}\n## 如何使用本站\n\n- **初学者**：从第 1 章开始，先建立\"路线识别\"的框架，再动手接工具。\n- **有 Stata 基础者**：直接跳到第 2 章，按讲义顺序完成扩展安装、内核注册与 MCP 接入。\n- **研究者与课题组**：重点阅读第 3、4 章，关注交付包规范、校验清单与飞书协同闭环。\n\n站内正文保持讲义原貌，章节标题、目录与导航按在线阅读习惯重新组织。\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     底部行动号召面板\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-panel\">\n  <div>\n    <h2>让 AI 接上 Stata，让科研流程可协同、可复现</h2>\n    <p>从一条 do 命令到一组并行检验，从单机探索到课题组级流水线 —— 这套工具链把因果实证的每个环节都变成可交付、可核验的成果。</p>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--secondary\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">开始学习 →</a>\n</div>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     Hero 区域 —— 主视觉与核心行动号召\n     ============================================================ -->\n<section class=\"econ-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n  <div class=\"econ-hero__content\">\n    <span class=\"econ-eyebrow\">在线讲义 · 组织智能体 · 因果实证科研</span>\n    <h1 id=\"hero-title\">豆包工作 × Stata 在线书籍</h1>\n    <p class=\"econ-hero__lead\">\n      豆包工作 + AIStata MCP + Stata-Kernel-Jupyter<br>\n      面向经管社科因果推断的组织智能体科研流水线\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"econ-hero__tech\">\n      <span>组织智能体</span>\n      <span>MCP 连接器</span>\n      <span>常驻内核</span>\n      <span>论文复现</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"econ-hero__subtitle\">\n      从工具链部署、Stata 内核接入，到论文复现与批量实证作业调度，把「写—跑—验—交」串成可协同、可留痕、可复现的完整链路。\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"econ-hero__meta\">\n      <span>4 大章节</span>\n      <span>7 份原始讲义</span>\n      <span>双形态 Stata 扩展</span>\n      <span>持续更新</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-actions\">\n      <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--primary\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">开始阅读</a>\n      <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--outline\" href=\"#compat\">了解兼容性</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     数据统计条\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-stats\">\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">4</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">核心章节</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">7</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">讲义文档</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\"> \n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">扩展形态</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-stat\">\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__number\">L4</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-stat__label\">组织级调度</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 导语：为什么是这套工具链 {#why}\n\n本站以**讲义原文为主线**，围绕豆包工作中的 Stata 执行能力展开：先用组织智能体范式理解\"人—AI—工具\"的分工，再把 AIStata MCP 与 Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 接进日常科研，最后落到论文复现与整条实证科研流水线。\n\n一句话概括这套组合的定位：\n\n> 豆包工作 + AIStata MCP + Stata-Kernel-Jupyter —— 面向经管社科因果推断的组织智能体科研流水线。\n\n这套组合提供两条接入形态：**VS Code 扩展插件**与 **MCP 协议连接器**。下面的章节按\"范式认知 → 工具接入 → 论文复现 → 流水线调度\"的顺序展开。\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     兼容性说明 —— 主流 Agent / IDE 卡片网格\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-compat\" id=\"compat\">\n  <div class=\"econ-compat__head\">\n    <h2>主流 AI Agent / IDE，都能接上我们的 Stata 扩展</h2>\n    <p>自研扩展同时提供 VS Code 扩展插件与 MCP 协议两种形态 —— 凡是支持任一种的 Agent 与编辑器，都能与 Stata 交互执行、读数据、出图。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"econ-agent-grid\">\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#f1f3f5;--icon-fg:#343a40\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.6 20.2 7v10L12 21.4 3.8 17V7Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Codex</strong><small>OpenAI 编码 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#fbede8;--icon-fg:#d97757\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\"/></g><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Claude Code</strong><small>Anthropic 终端 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#eef0f3;--icon-fg:#111827\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.2\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>OpenCode</strong><small>开源编码 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e7f0ff;--icon-fg:#2563eb\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"15.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">WB</text></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>WorkBuddy</strong><small>国产 Agent 工作台</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badges\"><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e6f7ee;--icon-fg:#14a06a\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5.5h16v10.5H9l-5 4Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"10.7\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Trae / TraeCN</strong><small>国产 AI IDE · 字节出品</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badges\"><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span><span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e9f8ef;--icon-fg:#159947\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8.5 8 4 4-4 4M13 16h3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>TraeWork</strong><small>原 TraeSolo · 工作流</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e8f0ff;--icon-fg:#4d6bfe\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M6.5 13.5c2.2-4.8 6.8-5.7 10.8-2.4-1.6 4.5-6 6.6-10.8 2.4Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>DeepSeek Harness</strong><small>深度探索 Agent 框架</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e7f0ff;--icon-fg:#2563eb\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2.5\" y=\"4\" width=\"19\" height=\"16\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"15.8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">DB</text></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>豆包工作</strong><small>字节跳动 Agent</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#e6f2ff;--icon-fg:#007acc\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3 19 12 5 21V3Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8.5 8.5 6.5 3.5-6.5 3.5Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>VS Code 扩展</strong><small>微软编辑器原生扩展</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#eef0f3;--icon-fg:#24292f\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 7.2a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1.5 9.36c.24.05.33-.1.33-.24v-.9c-1.35.3-1.64-.57-1.64-.57-.22-.56-.54-.71-.54-.71-.44-.3.03-.3.03-.3.49.03.75.5.75.5.44.75 1.14.53 1.42.4.04-.32.17-.53.31-.65-1.08-.12-2.22-.54-2.22-2.4 0-.53.19-.96.5-1.3-.05-.12-.22-.62.05-1.28 0 0 .4-.13 1.33.5a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 2.42 0c.92-.63 1.32-.5 1.32-.5.28.66.1 1.16.05 1.28.31.34.5.77.5 1.3 0 1.87-1.14 2.28-2.23 2.4.18.15.33.45.33.91v1.35c0 .13.09.29.33.24A4.8 4.8 0 0 0 12 7.2Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>GitHub Copilot</strong><small>GitHub 编码助手</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#f3eefe;--icon-fg:#7c3aed\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"m8 7 8 5-8 5Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Cursor / Windsurf</strong><small>AI 原生编辑器 · 含 Cline / Roo Code</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--mcp\">MCP</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"econ-agent\">\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__icon\" style=\"--icon-bg:#fff3e6;--icon-fg:#e07a39\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8.6\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"8.6\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"13.5\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#fff\"/></svg>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__text\"><strong>Jupyter / Quarto</strong><small>笔记本与动态文档</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-agent__badge econ-agent__badge--ext\">扩展</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 实战文章与接入指南 {#articles}\n\n从一站式科研平台到 Claude Code、DeepSeek Harness、opencode、Codex、豆包工作、GitHub Copilot、TraeCN / TraeWork，这些实战记录完整呈现了各家 Agent 与 IDE 调用 Stata 的过程；另附 MCP 接入与平台适配说明。\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-article-group\">\n  <h3 class=\"econ-article-group__title\">在各家 Agent 里跑 Stata</h3>\n  <div class=\"econ-article-grid\">\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kar5Ty8vMOgHDKtu33qFmA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">01</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在一站式科研平台里面用 ClaudeCode 跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>Claude Code · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770814&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=52593905910f16382a151573bba24346&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">02</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 DeepseekHarness 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>DeepSeek Harness · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770748&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9045c7a7b07832934cb070739d642440&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">03</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 opencode 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>OpenCode · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770765&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e41b43f003b3472afa470d255779e977&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">04</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 Codex 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>Codex · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770651&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=179721060d58c1cc9f262b8d1f3080c8&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">05</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 豆包工作 里面跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>豆包工作 · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770789&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d7fc875ff23132232c9472b1154afd66&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">06</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 GithubCopilot 里跑 Stata 代码 Bacon 分解</strong><small>GitHub Copilot · Bacon 分解</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770799&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=11c1bcd3b185a315a410390a663e1df6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">07</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>我在 TraeCN/TraeWork 跑 Stata 代码</strong><small>TraeCN / TraeWork · 实战记录</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-article-group\">\n  <h3 class=\"econ-article-group__title\">MCP 接入与平台适配</h3>\n  <div class=\"econ-article-grid\">\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qiQzZ6amy_hTi1SlVE6uqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">08</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>AIStata MCP 接入主流 Agent 平台</strong><small>MCP · 接入指南</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"econ-article\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NTM4NjU2OA==&amp;mid=2650770556&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a4fb8f2bce01c511dd2f1d255e7d7c9a&amp;scene=142&amp;poc_token=HBxrAmujL-gt_e5_EclIHaUaL1DnYu0VngDTtJK0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n      <span class=\"econ-article__no\">09</span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__body\"><strong>AIStata MCP 全面适配 Workbuddy、Trae、ClaudeCode 等主流 AI Agent，附论文复现展示</strong><small>MCP · 适配与论文复现</small></span>\n      <span class=\"econ-article__arrow\">↗</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 内容概览\n\n本在线书籍按四章组织，正文均来自原始讲义，仅作章节化排版与导航整理。配套仓库、公开课入口与项目主页见「资源导航」。\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     章节卡片网格\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-card-grid\">\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 1 章</span>\n    <h3>豆包工作流</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">从 AI × 计量工具的四条技术路线讲起，厘清组织智能体\"委派—并行—校验—交付\"范式，并完成环境搭建、MCP 接入与连通性验证。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 × StataMCP 实证科研流水线（讲义全本上篇）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/02-stata.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 2 章</span>\n    <h3>Stata专题</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">三份讲义合并编排：Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 扩展简介、在豆包工作中的连接器入门，以及计量经济网科研平台中的综合应用。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：扩展简介 / 豆包工作入门指南 / 科研平台应用</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/03-reproduction.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 3 章</span>\n    <h3>论文复现</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">以单任务因果推断的标准调度流为主线，覆盖 DID、RDD、PSM 全流程，并延伸到前沿方法矩阵、飞书协同闭环与学术伦理。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 · 论文复现专题（讲义全本中下篇）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/04-pipeline.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">第 4 章</span>\n    <h3>实证科研流</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">完整呈现组织智能体驱动的因果实证科研流水线：批次设计、并行委派、交付包规范、容错重跑与综合实战工坊。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">开始阅读 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：豆包工作 × StataMCP 实证科研流水线（全本）</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"econ-card\" href=\"chapters/05-resources.html\">\n    <span class=\"econ-card__number\">附录</span>\n    <h3>资源导航</h3>\n    <p class=\"econ-card__desc\">本书仓库、最新公开课与系列专题课入口，AIStata MCP 与 Stata-Kernel-Jupyter 项目主页，以及 AI 工具导航与配套课程。</p>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__link\">查看资源 →</span>\n    <span class=\"econ-card__meta\">来源：在线资源</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n```\n\n## 学习路径 {#roadmap}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"econ-flow\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"在线书籍学习路径\">\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">豆包工作流</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">Stata专题</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">论文复现</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">实证科研流</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__arrow\">→</span>\n  <span class=\"econ-flow__step\" role=\"listitem\">资源导航</span>\n</div>\n```\n\n| 如果你的目标是 | 建议从哪里开始 |\n|:---------------|:---------------|\n| 判断该用哪条 AI × Stata 路线 | 第 1 章：豆包工作流 |\n| 在 VS Code / Jupyter / 豆包工作里跑通 Stata | 第 2 章：Stata专题 |\n| 复现一篇因果推断论文并留存交付物 | 第 3 章：论文复现 |\n| 给课题组搭建批量检验与评审闭环 | 第 4 章：实证科研流 |\n| 找到仓库、公开课与项目主页 | 附录：资源导航 |\n\n::: {.callout-note}\n## 如何使用本站\n\n- **初学者**：从第 1 章开始，先建立\"路线识别\"的框架，再动手接工具。\n- **有 Stata 基础者**：直接跳到第 2 章，按讲义顺序完成扩展安装、内核注册与 MCP 接入。\n- **研究者与课题组**：重点阅读第 3、4 章，关注交付包规范、校验清单与飞书协同闭环。\n\n站内正文保持讲义原貌，章节标题、目录与导航按在线阅读习惯重新组织。\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- ============================================================\n     底部行动号召面板\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"econ-panel\">\n  <div>\n    <h2>让 AI 接上 Stata，让科研流程可协同、可复现</h2>\n    <p>从一条 do 命令到一组并行检验，从单机探索到课题组级流水线 —— 这套工具链把因果实证的每个环节都变成可交付、可核验的成果。</p>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"econ-btn econ-btn--secondary\" href=\"chapters/01-workflow.html\">开始学习 →</a>\n</div>\n```\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":false,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":false,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":false,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"message":false,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"center","fig-pos":null,"fig-e